# BHN — Tor non-exit middle relay configuration.
# Helsinki EU-NORTH exit node (BHN-HELSINKI-EU1), 2026-06-27.
#
# Role: middle relay ONLY. Never exit relay. EU-side privacy layer
# alongside Hillsboro (US-WEST). Bandwidth matched to Hillsboro to keep
# monthly accounting consistent across both BHN relay nodes.

## ─── Identity ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Nickname BHNAuroraEU1
ContactInfo admin@eventhorizonvpn.com

## ─── Ports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ORPort 9001
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050         # enabled 2026-07-13 / SearXNG Tor-proxy fallback
# DirPort 9030      # optional; commented to reduce surface

## ─── Relay type (explicit non-exit) ────────────────────────────────────
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*       # belt + suspenders — refuse all exit traffic
BridgeRelay 0               # middle relay, not bridge

## ─── Bandwidth limits — matched to Hillsboro (BHNHeliosUS3) ───────────
# Hillsboro: 512 KB / 1 MB burst / 750 GB monthly.
# Helsinki matches for consistency; Hetzner CX23 has 20 TB/month so
# headroom is ample. Raise both nodes together if monitoring shows room.
RelayBandwidthRate 512 KB
RelayBandwidthBurst 1 MB
AccountingMax 750 GB
AccountingStart month 1 00:00

## ─── Memory cap ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MaxMemInQueues 256 MB

## ─── Data + logging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log
Log notice stdout

## ─── Hardening ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AssumeReachable 0
ControlSocket 0

## ─── MyFamily ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both BHN relays declared in MyFamily so Tor consensus never routes a
# circuit through Hillsboro and Helsinki simultaneously.
#
# BHNHeliosUS3  (Hillsboro): CEBFF0886A263D4EA1D6D08A7ED86138F98D10AA
# BHNAuroraEU1  (Helsinki):  6AA0F8D730220D992914DB599E6A305DB5384913
#
MyFamily $CEBFF0886A263D4EA1D6D08A7ED86138F98D10AA,$6AA0F8D730220D992914DB599E6A305DB5384913
